     2| * IVX Autonomy API — owner-only mounts for the new autonomy services.
     3| *
     4| * All routes are owner-gated and default to read-only/dry-run. No deploys,
     5| * no schema changes, no payments/billing, no secret values returned.
     6| *
     7| *   GET  /api/ivx/autonomy/status                       capability + env presence map
     8| *   POST /api/ivx/autonomy/cloudfront/invalidate        dry-run by default; apply=true requires owner
     9| *   POST /api/ivx/autonomy/secret-scan                  scan supplied content/patches (never logged)
    10| *   POST /api/ivx/autonomy/deploy-log/rotate            dry-run by default; apply=true requires owner
    11| *   GET  /api/ivx/autonomy/git/rollback-check           read-only GitHub HEAD~1 lookup
    12| *   POST /api/ivx/autonomy/uptime/probe                 run probe; persists JSONL summary
